  "bookId": "ACT",
  "reference": "Tim Pa Jomoor 22",
  "verseCount": 30,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "22",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "ACT 22"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "22",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 22:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Wutmera gi bacere nan, winji win gim'awaco riwin ma nyutho win paka angoye gi raco moro!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.22.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.22.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 22:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Munyo jowinjo go luwo Dhoyuda, jomedo kudirok; Paulo omedere luwo ama: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.22.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.22.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 22:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ACT.5.34+ACT.5.35+ACT.5.36+ACT.5.37+ACT.5.38+ACT.5.39"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Tim 5:34-39",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " “Abedo Jayuda, m'onywol i Tariso ma Silisia, to adongo Yerusalem won ka paka jafonjirok pa Gamaliel. Alimo fonji matek kwoŋ Cik pa kwarere mawan, aka oyido amiyere ri Were paka win bende ma win ka konon me. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.22.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.22.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 22:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ACT.8.3"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Tim 8:3",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ACT.26.9+ACT.26.10+ACT.26.11"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "26:9-11",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alwenyo gi ji ma joluwo Royo pa Yesu no tundo kiri i nek. Amako cwo gi mon aka abolo jo i od twec. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.22.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.22.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 22:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jadwoŋ pa jocway ri Were i wi migam kodi kitipa pa jotel pa ji gibe jonyalo ridho riwin ni aluwo gir'adieri. Alimo balwa wok bongi jo m'ondiki ri Joyuda jowoti wan ma Damasiko aka akidho koro mako ji kelo jo Yerusalem gi lijegere i cingi gin wocandi jo.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.22.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.22.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Paulo luwo kwoŋ wirok pere",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 22:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.22.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.22.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 22:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Aka munyo oyido atieko woth ariko Damasiko, dho kapa sawa aucel, lero madwoŋ owok malo abwap to thokan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.22.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.22.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 22:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gikenyo agore piny t'awinjo dwondi ŋata waco ran ni, ‘Saulo, Saulo! Raŋo ilwenyo kodan?’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.22.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.22.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 22:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Apenjo ni, ‘In iŋa, Rwoth?’ Owaco ran ni, ‘An Yesu ma Nazareth m'ilwenyo gine.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.22.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.22.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 22:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ji m'onwaŋo nikodan kenyo joneno lero no to jok'owinjo dwondi ŋat'onwaŋo luwo kodan no. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.22.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.22.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 22:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Apenjo go ni, ‘Atimi aŋo, Rwoth?’ Aka Rwoth owaco ran ni, ‘Ay malo idonji Damasiko, aka kenyo am'ibino waco rin gimoro je ma Were ocano rin timo.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.22.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.22.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 22:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Munyo waŋan onwaŋo otho ro lero m'oasere no, jowotan jomako cingan to joteran Damasiko.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.22.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.22.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 22:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.22.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.22.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 22:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Kenyo onwaŋo nitie nyatoro m'ilwoŋo ni Anania, jadin m'owinjo Cik mawan aka Joyuda je ma Damasiko jomiyo go dwoŋ swa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.22.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.22.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 22:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Go obino bongan to cungo kabutan to waco ni, ‘Omera Saulo, caki neno kendo!’ I hongo no won aneno kendo to aŋiyo go. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.22.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.22.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 22:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gikenyo go owaco ran ni, ‘Were pa kwarere mawan oyerin ni iŋey gima go mito, ni inyal neno Ŋat'otire pere gi winjo go munyo iwinjo dwonde won; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.22.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.22.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 22:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ameno ibino bedo jakony pere ma waco ri ji gim'itieko neno gi winjo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.22.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.22.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 22:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "To onyo aŋo m'idoko ikuro? Ay malo obatisa in, aka reco perin wolwoki woko munyo ilwoŋo nyingi go.’ ”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.22.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.22.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Lwoŋo pa Paulo ma kidho fonjo Jopath",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 22:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.22.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.22.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 22:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Agik Yerusalem, aka munyo akwayo i Ot pa Were, aneno cal m'omenyere ran ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.22.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.22.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 22:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "m'aneno iye Rwoth munyo waco ran ni, ‘Redi mayot ieye Yerusalem, rupiri ji ma ka jok'ojol gim'iwaco kwoŋan.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.22.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.22.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 22:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Adwoko ni, ‘Rwoth, kole joŋeyo maber paka yado akidho i kalamo pa Joyuda m'omore, amako jom'oyeyin, agoyo jo aka atero jo i twec. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.22.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.22.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 22:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ACT.7.58"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Tim 7:58",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aka munyo ineko jatiti Wac perin Stefano, oyido an kenyo, aka abende afoyo odoko aŋat'akuro kiri ruk pa joma joneko go.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.22.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.22.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 22:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rwoth owaco ran ni, ‘Kadhi, rupiri abino dhirin bor swa i dier Jopath.’ ”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.22.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.22.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 22:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.22.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.22.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 22:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ji onwaŋo jowinjo luwo pa Paulo cuka tundo i wac me, to jocako koko gi derino madwoŋ ni, “Kwany wi woko jalo i piny ka! Go kiripi wokwo kendo!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.22.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.22.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 22:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oyido jokoko aka jokwadho nangin pajo i hongo aka jowito fukefuke malo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.22.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.22.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 22:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gikenyo jasirikale madwoŋ owodho or nike woter Paulo i cel, to oro jo cwado go ma mito ŋeyo gim'omiyo Joyuda jokoko rigo ameno. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.22.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.22.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 22:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "To munyo jocowo kikoda go aka wocwadi, Paulo owaco ri jasirikale moro m'onwaŋo ocungo kenyo ni, “Kere cik yeyo win cwado ŋat'obedo anywola ma Roma kada fodi k'oosa go banja moro je?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.22.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.22.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 22:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Munyo jasirikale no owinjo ameno, okidho bongi jadwoŋ pa jolweny to penjo ni, “Wikidho timo aŋo? Kole jame obedo anywola ma Roma!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.22.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.22.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 22:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gikenyo jatel pa jolweny okidho bongi Paulo to penjo go ni, “Waci ran, ibedo Jaroma?” Paulo odwoko ni, “Ey.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.22.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.22.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 22:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jatel pa jolweny no owaco ni, “An alokere Jaroma munyo atieko culo pesa malac swa.” Paulo odwoko ni, “To an onywolan paka Jaroma.” ",
