        {
          "text": "Gikenyo piyo piyo, ji m'oyido jokidho kelo penji ri Paulo joeye gicen kwoŋe; aka jatel pa jolweny lworo omako munyo oneno ni Paulo obedo anywola ma Roma, aka ama go oyido otweyo gi lijegere.",
